'''''Epilobium obscurum''''' is a species of [[flowering plant]] belonging to the family [[Onagraceae]].<ref name="POWO">{{cite web |title=Epilobium obscurum Schreb. {{!}} Plants of the World Online {{!}} Kew Science |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:612128-1 |website=Plants of the World Online |access-date=15 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

Its native range is [[Macaronesia]], Northwestern Africa, Europe to Turkey.<ref name="POWO" />

